  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There has been some suggestions about having \"Notices for Events on Loading Screens\" and \"In-Game Event Calendar\" but I think it would be much better in many ways, that there would be a community-driven weekly/monthly world prop news+info panel(or one for VR News and one for Events) on the official Hub, like it shows on the image.\n\nThere would be members that would fetch information from Discord and In-Game, of course only use Legit News/Info and work together to compile the best possible and fun way of showing that on VRChat(by designing an image to put it there) so for whoever wants to get updated they read up directly in-game. (There could also be the possibility to look at past news or they are somehow accessible, limited number ofc)\n\nAlso I'll like to suggest a panel of the same type but that would fetch info from the Google Calendar that we have for Events, that can be looked(or mouse-hover) to see the rest of the info just like we do on the actual calendar.\n\n- Sorry if I made the suggestion too long, thank you !",
